            "tex": "ax^2 + bx + c = a(x - x_1)(x - x_2)"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "$x_1, x_2$ — корни уравнения $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$.",
              "$2x^2 - 7x + 3 = 2(x - 3)\\left(x - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = (x - 3)(2x - 1)$.",
